#: ../../hydrogen_chain/index.rst:2
msgid "水素原子鎖の電子バンド形成"
msgstr "Electronic Band Formation in a Hydrogen Atom Chain"

#: ../../hydrogen_chain/index.rst:4
msgid ""
"水素原子を等間隔に並べた鎖の軌道エネルギーをPsi4で計算し、原子数を増やすと準位がバンドのように密集するかを調べます。\\ あわせて"
"、RHFとRKS-PBEで軌道ギャップの原子数依存性が大きく異なる理由を、結合次数とスピン分極から調べます。"
msgstr ""
"We use Psi4 to compute the orbital energies of a chain of equally spaced "
"hydrogen atoms and examine whether the levels crowd together like a band "
"as the number of atoms increases. \\ We also use bond orders and spin "
"polarization to examine why the dependence of the orbital gap on atom "
"count differs greatly between RHF and RKS-PBE."

